---
import { PROMPT } from '../../lib/prompt.ts';
---

<aside class="agent-callout not-content" aria-label="Using an agent?" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <span class="agent-callout-label">// using an agent?</span>
  <span class="agent-callout-text">Your agent can read the same summary, or <code>--json</code>. Ask it to explain each failure with its evidence IDs.</span>
  <button type="button" class="agent-callout-copy" data-copy-text={PROMPT} data-copied-label="Copied. Paste into your agent">Copy the agent setup prompt</button>
</aside>
